{"id":"n87484-1-10","stage":5,"title":"흡연 · 吸烟","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87484-1-10-1","ko":"이곳에서는 흡연이 금지되어 있어요.","zh":"这里是禁止吸烟的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이곳에서는","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"이곳：这里，这儿；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"이곳","audio":"/audio/f7b06733762a4646c18b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71130","senseId":"1","lemma":"이곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이곳에서는","audio":"/audio/06b5955acc56b5091320.mp3"}},{"text":"흡연이","meaning":"吸烟，抽烟","explanation":"흡연：吸烟，抽烟；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"흡연","audio":"/audio/2dc09ce6436bac531eb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87484","senseId":"1","lemma":"흡연","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"흡연이","audio":"/audio/ce8fc51ce5db829075ea.mp3"}},{"text":"금지되어","meaning":"受到禁止，被禁止","explanation":"금지되다：受到禁止，被禁止；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"금지되다","audio":"/audio/2304b97fba17ede4d2b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37208","senseId":"1","lemma":"금지되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"금지되어","audio":"/audio/6a4b8a5ad077ba513ab8.mp3"}},{"text":"있어요.","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어요","audio":"/audio/499f8423f214354759ff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7b06733762a4646","term":"이곳","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/f7b06733762a4646c18b.mp3","entryId":"71130","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["이곧"]},{"id":"2dc09ce6436bac53","term":"흡연","zh":"吸烟，抽烟","audio":"/audio/2dc09ce6436bac531eb3.mp3","entryId":"87484","definition":"抽香烟。","pronunciation":["흐변"]},{"id":"2304b97fba17ede4","term":"금지되다","zh":"受到禁止，被禁止","audio":"/audio/2304b97fba17ede4d2b4.mp3","entryId":"37208","de